AltoDaoMintMarket::setPublicAccessEnabled
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── given publicAccessEnabled is already true
    │   └── it should revert
    └── given publicAccessEnabled is false
        ├── when parameter is true
        │   ├── it should set publicAccessEnabled to true
        │   └── it should emit SetPublicAccessEnabled event
        ├── when parameter is false
        │   ├── it should set publicAccessEnabled to false
        │   └── it should emit SetPublicAccessEnabled event
        └── when enabling then trying to change
            ├── it should set publicAccessEnabled to true on first call
            └── it should revert on subsequent calls

